    "# AdEase Case Study"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "bh7sIgidAUyS"
   },
   "source": [
    "## Problem Statement\n",
    "AdEase is an ad-infrastructure company. It helps clients get the maximum clicks at minimum cost. An ad can only be shown where there is traffic, so page views are AdEase's raw inventory. If AdEase knows how many views a page group will get tomorrow, next week or next month, it can:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. predict how many impressions are available to sell\n",
    "2. decide which pages and languages deserve a client’s budget\n",
    "3. price inventory sensibly and avoid over-promising impressions\n",
    "4. time campaigns for high-traffic days\n",
    "\n",
    "## Goal\n",
    "To forecast daily page views for each language so Ad Ease can plan/optimise ad placement."
   ]
  },
